  "system": {
    "identifier": "shadowjack",
    "description": {
      "value": "<h1 data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"681\">🕶 SHADOWJACK</h1><p data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"736\"><em data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"736\">“You are not invisible.<br data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"710\" />You are unaccounted for.”</em></p><h3 data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"757\">Primary Ability</h3><p data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"771\"><strong data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"771\">Dexterity</strong></p><h3 data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"781\">Role</h3><p data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"837\">Infiltrator • System invalidator • High-agency operator</p><p data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"912\">Shadowjacks do not overpower defenses.<br data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"880\" />They <strong data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"911\">invalidate assumptions</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"1053\">Locks, wards, patrol routes, social barriers, and magical protections are not walls — they are stories people tell themselves about safety.</p><p data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1089\">Shadowjacks ask only one question:</p><p data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1122\"><strong data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1122\">“Who forgot to imagine me?”</strong></p><hr data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1127\" /><h2 data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1159\">Class Fantasy (Plain Truth)</h2><p data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1181\">Shadowjacks convert:</p><ul data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1245\"><li data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1198\"><p data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1198\">Bold intrusion</p></li><li data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1219\"><p data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1219\">Clever positioning</p></li><li data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1234\"><p data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1234\">Misdirection</p></li><li data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1245\"><p data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1245\">Audacity</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1278\">…into <strong data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1277\">operational leverage</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1298\">They thrive where:</p><ul data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1372\"><li data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1320\"><p data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1320\">Security is layered</p></li><li data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1343\"><p data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1343\">Attention is limited</p></li><li data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1372\"><p data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1372\">Mistakes have consequences</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1426\">Shadowjacks are strongest <strong data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1425\">before the net closes</strong>.</p><hr data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1431\" /><h2 data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1476\">🗝 Core Class Feature — Access (Level 1)</h2><p data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1536\">Shadowjacks operate on a unique resource: <strong data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1535\">Access Dice</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1608\">Access represents <strong data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1607\">temporary advantage stolen from the environment</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1695\"><li data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1622\"><p data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1622\">Blind spots</p></li><li data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1641\"><p data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1641\">Unsecured routes</p></li><li data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1661\"><p data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1661\">Miscommunications</p></li><li data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1695\"><p data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1695\">Moments where no one is looking</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1712\">Access Dice</h3><ul data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1887\"><li data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1730\"><p data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1730\">Start as <strong data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1730\">d6</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1812\"><p data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1745\">Increase at:</p><ul data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1812\"><li data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1766\"><p data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1766\"><strong data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1766\">Level 5 → d8</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1789\"><p data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1789\"><strong data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1789\">Level 11 → d10</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1812\"><p data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1812\"><strong data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1812\">Level 17 → d12</strong></p></li></ul></li><li data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1887\"><p data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1887\">Maximum stored Access Dice =<br data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1846\" /><strong data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1887\">your Dexterity modifier (minimum 1)</strong></p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1961\">Access is momentum.<br data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"1911\" />It rewards initiative and audacity — not patience.</p><hr data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"1966\" /><h2 data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"1990\">Gaining Access Dice</h2><p data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2059\">You gain <strong data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2017\">1 Access Die</strong> when <strong data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2034\">any one</strong> of the following occurs:</p><ul data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2332\"><li data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2151\"><p data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2112\">You successfully bypass a <strong data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2112\">meaningful obstacle</strong></p><ul data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2151\"><li data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2121\"><p data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2121\">Lock</p></li><li data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2130\"><p data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2130\">Ward</p></li><li data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2140\"><p data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2140\">Guard</p></li><li data-start=\"2143\" data-end=\"2151\"><p data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2151\">System</p></li></ul></li><li data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2200\"><p data-start=\"2154\" data-end=\"2200\">You begin your turn <strong data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2200\">unseen or undiscovered</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2268\"><p data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2268\">You exploit an enemy’s blind spot, distraction, or overcommitment</p></li><li data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2332\"><p data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2332\">You succeed on a <strong data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2332\">high-risk infiltration or deception play</strong></p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2395\">⚠️ <strong data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2347\">Limit:</strong><br data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2350\" />You may gain <strong data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2394\">only 1 Access Die per round</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2435\">Access comes fast.<br data-start=\"2415\" data-end=\"2418\" />It leaves faster.</p><hr data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2440\" /><h2 data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2465\">Spending Access Dice</h2><p data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2496\">You may spend Access Dice to:</p><ul data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2757\"><li data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2549\"><p data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2549\">Bypass simple locks or barriers <strong data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2549\">without tools</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2588\"><p data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2588\">Reduce or avoid <strong data-start=\"2568\" data-end=\"2588\">alarm escalation</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2639\"><p data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2639\">Create a temporary <strong data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2628\">backdoor route</strong> for allies</p></li><li data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2695\"><p data-start=\"2642\" data-end=\"2695\">Force security systems to <strong data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2695\">misreport your presence</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2757\"><p data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2757\">Slip past reactions, zones of control, or detection effects</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2787\">Access is meant to be spent.</p><p data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2831\">Hoarding it is how Shadowjacks get caught.</p><hr data-start=\"2833\" data-end=\"2836\" /><h2 data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2866\">⚠ Pushback System — Trace</h2><p data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"2899\">Shadowjacks leave fingerprints.</p><p data-start=\"2901\" data-end=\"2945\">Sometimes literal.<br data-start=\"2919\" data-end=\"2922\" />Sometimes metaphysical.</p><p data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"3045\"><strong data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"2956\">Trace</strong> represents <strong data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"2988\">system awareness</strong> — the moment defenses realize <em data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3037\">someone like you</em> exists.</p><h3 data-start=\"3047\" data-end=\"3071\">You Gain Trace When:</h3><ul data-start=\"3072\" data-end=\"3228\"><li data-start=\"3072\" data-end=\"3103\"><p data-start=\"3074\" data-end=\"3103\">An infiltration attempt fails</p></li><li data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3140\"><p data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3140\">You are seen while spending Access</p></li><li data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3182\"><p data-start=\"3143\" data-end=\"3182\">You trigger alarms, wards, or attention</p></li><li data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3228\"><p data-start=\"3185\" data-end=\"3228\">You overextend beyond plausible deniability</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"3230\" data-end=\"3233\" /><h2 data-start=\"3235\" data-end=\"3272\">Trace Thresholds (How Trace Works)</h2><p data-start=\"3274\" data-end=\"3315\">As Trace accumulates, the world tightens.</p><h3 data-start=\"3317\" data-end=\"3333\">Trace States</h3><ul data-start=\"3335\" data-end=\"3606\"><li data-start=\"3335\" data-end=\"3388\"><p data-start=\"3337\" data-end=\"3347\"><strong data-start=\"3337\" data-end=\"3347\">Pinged</strong></p><ul data-start=\"3350\" data-end=\"3388\"><li data-start=\"3350\" data-end=\"3388\"><p data-start=\"3352\" data-end=\"3388\">Enemies gain advantage to detect you</p></li></ul></li><li data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3468\"><p data-start=\"3392\" data-end=\"3403\"><strong data-start=\"3392\" data-end=\"3403\">Flagged</strong></p><ul data-start=\"3406\" data-end=\"3468\"><li data-start=\"3406\" data-end=\"3436\"><p data-start=\"3408\" data-end=\"3436\">Reinforcements arrive faster</p></li><li data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3468\"><p data-start=\"3441\" data-end=\"3468\">Locks and scrutiny increase</p></li></ul></li><li data-start=\"3470\" data-end=\"3548\"><p data-start=\"3472\" data-end=\"3489\"><strong data-start=\"3472\" data-end=\"3489\">Burned Routes</strong></p><ul data-start=\"3492\" data-end=\"3548\"><li data-start=\"3492\" data-end=\"3505\"><p data-start=\"3494\" data-end=\"3505\">Exits close</p></li><li data-start=\"3508\" data-end=\"3527\"><p data-start=\"3510\" data-end=\"3527\">Safe paths vanish</p></li><li data-start=\"3530\" data-end=\"3548\"><p data-start=\"3532\" data-end=\"3548\">Security hardens</p></li></ul></li><li data-start=\"3550\" data-end=\"3606\"><p data-start=\"3552\" data-end=\"3567\"><strong data-start=\"3552\" data-end=\"3567\">Compromised</strong></p><ul data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3606\"><li data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3606\"><p data-start=\"3572\" data-end=\"3606\">You are actively hunted or cut off</p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-start=\"3608\" data-end=\"3632\">Trace clears <strong data-start=\"3621\" data-end=\"3631\">slowly</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"3633\" data-end=\"3678\"><li data-start=\"3633\" data-end=\"3643\"><p data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3643\">Downtime</p></li><li data-start=\"3644\" data-end=\"3657\"><p data-start=\"3646\" data-end=\"3657\">Clever play</p></li><li data-start=\"3658\" data-end=\"3678\"><p data-start=\"3660\" data-end=\"3678\">Subclass abilities</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"3680\" data-end=\"3725\">Shadowjacks do not die because they are weak.</p><p data-start=\"3727\" data-end=\"3765\">They die because they stayed too long.</p><hr data-start=\"3767\" data-end=\"3770\" /><h2 data-start=\"3772\" data-end=\"3816\">🧠 How Shadowjacks Play (Player Guidance)</h2><p data-start=\"3818\" data-end=\"3872\">Shadowjacks are <strong data-start=\"3834\" data-end=\"3860\">high-agency, high-risk</strong> characters.</p><p data-start=\"3874\" data-end=\"3886\">They reward:</p><ul data-start=\"3887\" data-end=\"3922\"><li data-start=\"3887\" data-end=\"3901\"><p data-start=\"3889\" data-end=\"3901\">Decisiveness</p></li><li data-start=\"3902\" data-end=\"3914\"><p data-start=\"3904\" data-end=\"3914\">Creativity</p></li><li data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"3922\"><p data-start=\"3917\" data-end=\"3922\">Nerve</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"3924\" data-end=\"3936\">They punish:</p><ul data-start=\"3937\" data-end=\"3982\"><li data-start=\"3937\" data-end=\"3949\"><p data-start=\"3939\" data-end=\"3949\">Hesitation</p></li><li data-start=\"3950\" data-end=\"3964\"><p data-start=\"3952\" data-end=\"3964\">Overplanning</p></li><li data-start=\"3965\" data-end=\"3982\"><p data-start=\"3967\" data-end=\"3982\">Playing it safe</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"3984\" data-end=\"4045\">If Titanbound are inevitable<br data-start=\"4012\" data-end=\"4015\" />and Aurablades are emotional</p><p data-start=\"4047\" data-end=\"4081\">Shadowjacks are <strong data-start=\"4063\" data-end=\"4080\">opportunistic</strong>.</p><hr /><p><strong>BBTTCC Resource Actions:</strong> This patched class JSON grants Features-tab resource display/action items at level 1 for the runtime resource-action engine.</p>",
